    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Our metrics will generally have a measure planted along just one curve, which will be the geodesic from (0,0) to (0,1). Any measure planted outside of this geodesic will not increase its length, but may increase the length of paths other than F, which only reduces the possibility of F being a geodesic, all while increasing the rate."
